{
  "name": "AI Lead Follow-Up Agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (once)\n1. Credentials → add **Anthropic** (API key)\n2. Credentials → add **Gmail OAuth2** (sender account)\n3. Credentials → add **Airtable Personal Access Token**\n4. Airtable base **Lead Agent**, table **Leads** with fields:\n   name | timestamp | email | phone | message | score | category | summary | status | reply_subject\n5. Open the **three Airtable nodes** (Dupe Check + both Log Lead) → pick base + table\n6. Open **Normalize Lead** → set business_name, sender_name, booking_url\n7. Activate, open the Form URL, submit a test lead 🚀\n\n📺 60-sec demo + guided setup: https://lead-agent.guilhermecbanjos.workers.dev",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo tips\n- Test leads to submit (from demo-script.md):\n  HOT: \"Burst pipe in my kitchen, need someone TODAY, budget no issue\"\n  WARM: \"Thinking about renovating a bathroom sometime this year, ballpark?\"\n  COLD: \"Do you want to buy SEO services for your website?\"\n- Cost tip: switch the Qualify node's model to claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (cheaper) — keep Sonnet for the reply.\n- The Gmail Trigger (email intake) ships disabled — enable it after connecting Gmail if you want email leads too.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "sticky-tips",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Demo tips",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Atlas Home Services — Get a Quote",
        "formDescription": "Tell us what you need and we'll get back to you within minutes.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Phone"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "What do you need?",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "form-trigger",
      "name": "Lead Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": ""
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Email Lead (optional)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        220
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Map an inbound email into the same lead shape as the form\nconst m = $input.first().json;\nconst fromRaw = m.from?.value?.[0] || {};\nconst name = fromRaw.name || (typeof m.from === 'string' ? m.from : '') || 'Unknown';\nconst email = fromRaw.address || m.From || '';\nconst message = `${m.subject || ''} — ${m.text || m.snippet || ''}`.slice(0, 2000);\nreturn [{ json: { Name: name, Email: email, Phone: '', 'What do you need?': message } }];"
      },
      "id": "normalize-email",
      "name": "Email → Lead shape",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        20,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.Name || $json.name || 'Unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.Email || $json.email || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $json.Phone || $json.phone || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json['What do you need?'] || $json.message || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "business_name",
              "value": "Atlas Home Services",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a6",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "Alex",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a7",
              "name": "booking_url",
              "value": "https://cal.com/your-handle/intro",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "normalize-lead",
      "name": "Normalize Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "anthropicApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6', max_tokens: 500, system: 'You qualify inbound leads for ' + $json.business_name + ', a services business. Score the lead 1-10 for likelihood to become a paying customer (10 = clear budget, urgent need, right service; 1 = spam or irrelevant). Respond with ONLY minified JSON, no markdown fences: {\"score\":<number>,\"category\":\"hot|warm|cold\",\"summary\":\"<one sentence>\",\"reason\":\"<one sentence>\"}', messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'New lead:\\nName: ' + $json.name + '\\nEmail: ' + $json.email + '\\nPhone: ' + ($json.phone || 'n/a') + '\\nMessage: ' + $json.message }] }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "qualify-claude",
      "name": "Qualify Lead (Claude)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Anthropic account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse Claude's qualification JSON (with fallback) and merge with the lead\nconst res = $input.first().json;\nlet text = res.content?.[0]?.text ?? '';\ntext = text.trim().replace(/^```(json)?/i, '').replace(/```$/, '').trim();\nlet q;\ntry { q = JSON.parse(text); }\ncatch (e) { q = { score: 5, category: 'warm', summary: text.slice(0, 200), reason: 'parse-fallback' }; }\nq.score = Number(q.score) || 0;\nconst lead = $('Normalize Lead').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...lead, ...q } }];"
      },
      "id": "parse-qualification",
      "name": "Parse Qualification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.score }}",
              "rightValue": 6,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-qualified",
      "name": "Qualified?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1560,
        0
